@startuml UC-USER-ACCOUNT-SUSPEND
' UC-32.2 - Suspend User Account | semantic key: UC-USER-ACCOUNT-SUSPEND
' Source: data/use_cases/system-administration/UC-USER-ACCOUNT-SUSPEND.yml
' Business Rules: BR-SYSADMIN-USER-ACCOUNT, BR-OWNER-ACCOUNT-DELETION-GUARD, BR-LAST-ADMINISTRATOR-PROTECTION, BR-AUDIT-EVENT-COMPLETENESS
' Trace comments ' [ref] name the YAML element behind the next action.
' No title: the Word caption supplies it.
' One Activity Final shared by all paths (team decision 2026-10-06; UML allows one or several). It
' is reached after the account is suspended and the audit event recorded (postconditions met) or
' with the account still active (EX-01, EX-02, AF-01).
' EX-01 and EX-02 share one decision: both are protections on the requested target account
' (BR-OWNER-ACCOUNT-DELETION-GUARD, BR-LAST-ADMINISTRATOR-PROTECTION) and both reject the request.
' AF-01.1 is an explicit System step of the YAML, so it is kept as an action.
' Layout (2026-10-06): the decision "Confirm suspension?" is drawn in the System lane, where the
' System waits for the System Administrator's answer; the guards name the System Administrator's
' choice. In the System Administrator lane its merge forced a detour across the lanes.
!include ../../_shared/activity-style.puml
|ADM| $lane_title("System Administrator")
|SYS| $lane_title("System")

|ADM|
start
' [NF1, TRIGGER, BR-SYSADMIN-USER-ACCOUNT]
:Select active User account
and request suspension;
|SYS|
if ($question_x("Account protected?")) then ($guard_left("[not protected]"))
  ' [NF2]
  :Display impact and request
  reason and confirmation;
  if ($question("Confirm suspension?")) then ($guard_left("[confirm]"))
    |ADM|
    ' [NF3]
    :Provide reason and
    confirm suspension;
    |SYS|
    ' [NF4, POST1, POST2, BR-AUDIT-EVENT-COMPLETENESS]
    :Suspend account and
    record audit event;
  else ($guard_right("[cancel", "— AF-01]"))
    |SYS|
    ' [AF-01.1]
    :Leave account active;
  endif
else ($guard_right("[current owner — EX-01 or", "last administrator — EX-02]"))
  ' [EX-01, EX-02, BR-OWNER-ACCOUNT-DELETION-GUARD, BR-LAST-ADMINISTRATOR-PROTECTION, GUIDE-7.3]
  :Reject suspension;
endif
|SYS|
stop
@enduml
